<p class="lead">Taking the kids on a fishing trip, can truly be an experience of a lifetime for them. We make it an exceptional day, by specifically making the trip about them. Our guides are all kid friendly, most of them having young kids themselves. We take a different approach to these trips by catering every single aspect of the adventure about them, from the specialized rods and reels, to the locations we fish, to the types of fish we target…</p>
