<div>
<h2>Where We fish</h2>
<p>We understand that this special day on the water can make the difference in whether they ever want to go again, we have you covered!! We fish the calm, protected waters of the backcountry. Fishing close to the many Mangrove islands where the fishing is amazingly easy and fast paced. There is never any chance of seas or rough water back there. We use our large 24’ Backcountry boats that are dry, stable and have plenty of room…</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec tint">
<div class="wrap two">
<div>
<h2>What We Catch</h2>
<p>These trips are all about action, and lots of it!! We understand that keeping the little ones interested and having fun is paramount. We start off our trips with a chum slick that produces instant action on Mangrove and Yellowtail Snappers, Yellow Jacks, Jack Crevalles, all fish that instantly respond to a chum bag for some easy fishing. As the bite progresses, they can also fish for the many Sharks and Barracudas that show up for a free meal!! The majority of the fish you catch are excellent eating, a great way to finish the day at Hurricane Hole Restaurant…</p>
</div>
